 ## Project Description:
 The Akan Name Generator is a web application that generates a user's traditional Akan Name based on their date of birth and gender . 

## Features
_Enter your date of Birth
_Select your gender
_Calculatethe day of the week you were born.
_Display the corresponding Akan name.
_Responsive and user-friendly interface

## Technologies
_ HTML
_CSS
_Java script

